# @ody/api-client

- **Never hand-edit** `packages/api-client/src/generated/**`.
- Wrong types or hooks → fix OpenAPI in `services/backend` (routes/schemas), then run `pnpm gen:contract`.
- Safe to edit: `orval.config.ts`, `src/mutator.ts`, `src/index.ts`.
- Dashboard must import API types/hooks from `@ody/api-client` only (no handwritten DTOs or raw fetch).
